{
    "title": "Rivian",
    "description": "The Rivian app works with your R1T and R1S to make driving and owning your Rivian simple. Use your phone as a key, manage charging sessions, tap into support and so much more: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Accept delivery of your Rivian\r\n\u2022 Make your phone a key to your R1T or R1S\r\n\u2022 Lock and unlock your vehicle remotely \r\n\u2022 Warm up or cool down your vehicle before you get in\r\n\u2022 Plan trips in the app to see recommended routes and charging stops based on your preferences\r\n\u2022 Search the map for points of interest and nearby chargers\u2014and send any destination to your vehicle\r\n\u2022 Check your Rivian's range and current charging status\r\n\u2022 Connect with our support team to ask questions and troubleshoot\r\n\u2022 Request and track vehicle service and roadside assistance\r\n\u2022 Start available vehicle software updates from the app \r\n\u2022 Connect with your home Rivian Wall Charger \r\n\r\nKeep the World Adventurous Forever.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Rivian app works with your R1T and R1S to make driving and owning your Rivian simple. Use your phone as a key, manage charging sessions, tap into support and so much more: <br><br>\u2022 Accept delivery of your Rivian<br>\u2022 Make your phone a key to your R1T or R1S<br>\u2022 Lock and unlock your vehicle remotely <br>\u2022 Warm up or cool down your vehicle before you get in<br>\u2022 Plan trips in the app to see recommended routes and charging stops based on your preferences<br>\u2022 Search the map for points of interest and nearby chargers\u2014and send any destination to your vehicle<br>\u2022 Check your Rivian&#39;s range and current charging status<br>\u2022 Connect with our support team to ask questions and troubleshoot<br>\u2022 Request and track vehicle service and roadside assistance<br>\u2022 Start available vehicle software updates from the app <br>\u2022 Connect with your home Rivian Wall Charger <br><br>Keep the World Adventurous Forever.",
